    family-names: Franco
    alias: gufranco
repository-code: https://github.com/gufranco/arm6-python
url: https://github.com/gufranco/arm6-python
abstract: >-
  A model of the ARM60, a 32 bit RISC processor, driven a cycle at a time and
  held to its own datasheet for every instruction and every cycle it spends.
  Every fact carries the sentence it came from and the page it was on, checked
  against a rendered image of that page because the document has no text layer,
  and the whole processor state is compared against a filtered corpus after each
  instruction. Nothing in it starts from a clean machine, because silicon powers
  up holding whatever it holds.
keywords:
